    "Optics": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Optics"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光学"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Option temporarily selects the eyedropper in painting tools. Shift constrains shapes/movement or adds to a selection; Option subtracts from selections or draws from center. Command-drag moves selected pixels; Command-Option-drag copies them. Option-drag duplicates layers/folders/effects; Option-click at a layer boundary toggles clipping. Command-click a thumbnail loads its selection. Control bypasses snapping. Right-drag adjusts brush size. Modifier-and-mouse gestures are fixed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Option temporarily selects the eyedropper in painting tools. Shift constrains shapes/movement or adds to a selection; Option subtracts from selections or draws from center. Command-drag moves selected pixels; Command-Option-drag copies them. Option-drag duplicates layers/folders/effects; Option-click at a layer boundary toggles clipping. Command-click a thumbnail loads its selection. Control bypasses snapping. Right-drag adjusts brush size. Modifier-and-mouse gestures are fixed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在绘画工具中，按住 Option 会临时选择吸管。Shift 可约束形状/移动方向，或添加到选区；Option 从选区中减去，或从中心绘制。Command 拖动可移动选中的像素；Command-Option 拖动可复制它们。Option 拖动可复制图层/文件夹/效果；在图层边界处按住 Option 单击可切换剪切蒙版。Command 单击缩览图可载入其选区。Control 可绕过吸附。右键拖动可调整画笔大小。修饰键与鼠标的手势是固定的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
